  "title": "DHT Holdings, Inc. Announces Fleet Update",
  "summary": "HAMILTON, BERMUDA, July 24, 2026 – DHT Holdings, Inc. (NYSE:DHT) (“DHT” or the “Company”) today announces key developments in its fleet renewal program. The Company has taken delivery of DHT Impala, a VLCC newbuilding from Hyundai Samho Heavy Industries. The vessel is entering the spot market and represents the fourth and final vessel in a […]",
